        "original_id": "17a0be4e-c053-57db-8cd8-8efd42950131",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- Characters: Karl C. Agathon\n- Companies: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- TV series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., Battlestar Galactica\n\nFacts:\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founded Bellwether Pictures.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Buffy the Vampire Slayer (1997–2003), Angel (1999–2004), Firefly (2002), Dollhouse (2009–10), and Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. (from 2013).\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the TV series Supernatural, Dollhouse, and Continuum.\n- Karl C. Agathon, also called Helo, is a fictional character on the re-imagined Battlestar Galactica TV series.\n- Tahmoh Penikett portrayed Karl C. Agathon on Battlestar Galactica.\n- Dollhouse was created by Joss Whedon and starred Tahmoh Penikett.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
